I am in the hallway.
My suitcase and my bags are standing on the floor.
They are very heavy.
I pull a large suitcase.
That is very loud.
The door next to me is suddenly open.
My neighbor, Frau Krüger, is standing in the door.
She looks at the bags in the hallway.
"Good morning, Frau Flores," she says.
"Do you need help?" she asks politely.
"Good morning, Frau Krüger," I answer.
"Yes, I would love some."
"The bags are really heavy."
Frau Krüger is very nice.
She immediately takes a large bag.
We walk together to the new flat.
We stand in front of the door.
The suitcase is now standing next to the door.
The large bag is lying on the floor.
"Thank you very much for your help," I say.
